v 3
d aaivaft: rank-based IV inference for accelerated failure time models
d
d Estimates the effect of an endogenous treatment on a duration in an
d accelerated failure time model with a binary instrument. Reports
d Hodges-Lehmann-Sen estimates and simulated rank confidence sets that are
d exact and robust to weak instruments, a least squares IV comparator, and a
d rank only benchmark without the instrument.
d
d Requires: Stata 14 and moremata (ssc install moremata)
d
d Authors: Leonardo Sanchez-Aragon (ESPOL), Anand Acharya (Carleton, deceased),
d Kusum Menon (University of Ottawa), Marcel Voia (Universite d'Orleans)
d Contact: lfsanche@espol.edu.ec
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261019
d Version: 1.0.0
d
